# LLMDD Advisor approval tokens.
#
# Two standing grants are tracked: llmdd-workspace (operating .LLMDD design
# artifacts and .LLMDD tools) and git-global (recording changes, never making
# them). Both are identical in every repository. Scenario-specific grants are
# local-only: they are narrow, they expire, and committing one bakes a
# permission slip into permanent history that cannot be revoked by git.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!llmdd-workspace.json
!git-global.json
